OL,3,GNEWSASelf-taught barber wins accolade
OL,4,Aof best in the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man with the "best job in the world"
OL,7,Fwho learnt how to cut hair from online
OL,8,Fvideos has been crowned the UK's best
OL,9,Fbarber.
OL,11,FRahul Tanna, who owns "Tannatrims" in
OL,12,FThurmaston, Leicestershire, won the
OL,13,FLeading Awards Best Barber 2026.
OL,15,FThe 27-year-old said he was "so
OL,16,Fsurprised" to beat off competition from
OL,17,Fother talented barbers across the UK.
OL,19,FThe award honours new standards in
OL,20,Fprecision, creativity, and grooming
OL,21,Fexcellence.
